[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751989522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595#issuecomment-4751989522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595","id":4751989522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGz2bEg","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T13:29:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T13:35:31Z","body":"The changes here look good, but loading meshes from 3.7 with octahedral compression is still broken:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"790\" height=\"662\" alt=\"oct3_7\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f81b4dbb-7996-4d98-8039-c0069f400640\" />\r\n\r\nIt looks like 4.x requires biasing the octahedron components to a 0.0 <-> 1.0 range, whereas in 3.x they were stored in the -1.0 <-> 1.0 range\r\n\r\nThe biasing seems to be already implemented for tangent and non-octahedron normal upgrading","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751989522/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4753578331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595#issuecomment-4753578331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595","id":4753578331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG1XZWw","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T17:24:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T17:24:40Z","body":"Shoot, how do we fix that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4753578331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754212962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595#issuecomment-4754212962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595","id":4754212962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG1-IYg","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T19:29:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T19:29:23Z","body":"> Shoot, how do we fix that?\r\n\r\nIn this segment:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/de831fbe91cce80f2340c7ff094ca644ec0300bf/scene/resources/mesh.cpp#L1107-L1125\r\n\r\nThe 8-bit octahedral normals should be handled like this:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nuint16_t *dst = (uint16_t *)&dst_vertex_ptr[i * dst_normal_tangent_stride + dst_offsets[Mesh::ARRAY_NORMAL]]; \r\n  \r\n dst[0] = (uint16_t)CLAMP((src[0] / 127.0f * .5f + .5f) * 65535, 0, 65535); \r\n dst[1] = (uint16_t)CLAMP((src[1] / 127.0f * .5f + .5f) * 65535, 0, 65535); \r\n```\r\n\r\nAs for the 16-bit ones:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nuint16_t *dst = (uint16_t *)&dst_vertex_ptr[i * dst_normal_tangent_stride + dst_offsets[Mesh::ARRAY_NORMAL]]; \r\n  \r\ndst[0] = (uint16_t)CLAMP((src[0] / 32767.0f * .5f + .5f) * 65535, 0, 65535);\r\ndst[1] = (uint16_t)CLAMP((src[1] / 32767.0f * .5f + .5f) * 65535, 0, 65535);\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754212962/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754623756","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119595#issuecomment-4754623756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119595","id":4754623756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG2XNDA","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T20:49:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T20:49:14Z","body":"Implemented that; it looks like that was already done for Tangents, but not Normals.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754623756/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0